<translation id="942598560705308788">Vyeti vinavyodhibitiwa na Decentr</translation>
<translation id="965162752251293939">Ni nani anayetumia Decentr?</translation>
<translation id="967427899662692980">Pata usalama thabiti zaidi kutoka Decentr</translation>
<translation id="983803489796659991">Imeshindwa kusakinisha kwa sababu seva ya usasishaji haina data ya kupunguza urefu ya programu.</translation>
